<title>UK: TENNIS-RESULTS OF WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS OF WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Men's doubles semifinal at Wimbledon on Friday (Prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat 13-Martin Damm (Czech Republic)/Pavel Vizner (Czech Republic) 6-2 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
